  "ProjectName": "Test-Driven BooksToScrape Category Scraper",
  "Author": "",
  "ProjectDescription": "Demonstrates test-driven scraping of a books.toscrape.com category (default: Travel). Offline SequenceDetection generators derive the category and product-detail extraction patterns; the first-page books are processed and their title, price, rating, availability, and description are exported to XLSX.",
